{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "6cf31ee2-6759-5cb3-b6e2-e2bd3aba6b8a", "source_ordinal": 2440, "reading_ordinal": 1614, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "家族基金", "published_at": "2023-01-17T21:17:37+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/579248011/answer/2849908199"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这种东西，切忌“民主”和“灵活”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 17}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "举个奖学基金的例子：", "char_start": 18, "char_end": 28}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "首先明确定义此基金的受惠范围——直接指定一个名单或者完全明确的鉴定标准（例如DNA鉴定）。", "char_start": 29, "char_end": 74}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "受惠人可以凭毕业证书、学位证书、职业资格证、指定范围内的资质认证、指定范围内的奖章、功勋章等凭据，支取相应的补贴。", "char_start": 75, "char_end": 132}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "受惠人可以凭入学通知书和缴费发票领取低息学费贷款。", "char_start": 133, "char_end": 158}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "贷款优先由前述奖金抵消——一般毕业证书和学位证书对应的补贴可以抵消大部分学费贷款。", "char_start": 159, "char_end": 200}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "此基金也每年免费为受惠人提供意外伤害、意外医疗类保险。", "char_start": 201, "char_end": 228}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这个钱不能用于“应急”或者“支持投资”。并且使用权限、有效期限、最终解释由你自己单方面决定。", "char_start": 229, "char_end": 275}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "贷款、领取补贴均需要正式的文字手续，记录在案。", "char_start": 276, "char_end": 299}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "在你自己退休后，这个基金会转由你所选择的继承人管理。", "char_start": 300, "char_end": 326}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "注意看这个例子的执行原则——", "char_start": 328, "char_end": 342}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "1）它是绝对“独裁”因而是绝对受控的。", "char_start": 343, "char_end": 362}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "2）它的标准是客观明确、没有争议余地的。", "char_start": 363, "char_end": 383}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "3）它的服务是专项明确的。", "char_start": 384, "char_end": 397}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "4）它在资金上是可持续或至少是健康的。", "char_start": 398, "char_end": 417}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "5）它奖励努力的成果，而不负责“扶危济困”。", "char_start": 418, "char_end": 440}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "类似的东西是可以有其它的福利基金。", "char_start": 441, "char_end": 458}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "例如奖励发明创造、著书立说、奖励繁衍/收养后代等等。", "char_start": 459, "char_end": 485}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "例如，可以设立关于家族理念的考试，合格者有特别奖励，并有资格进入下一代基金董事会名单。", "char_start": 486, "char_end": 529}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "要想接过这个事业，保证家族正面发展，熟悉家族理念是一个绝对必备条件。", "char_start": 530, "char_end": 564}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "实际上我所写的全部东西，都是为了给你们创立自己的家族理念所做的底稿。", "char_start": 565, "char_end": 599}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "有人在维持这个基金的运作，你们家族的后代就势必要比没有这个机制辅助的竞争对手享有战略性的优势。", "char_start": 601, "char_end": 648}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "光是节省下来的心理治疗费用、避免的恶劣人生选择，就足以让家族后代占有先发优势。", "char_start": 649, "char_end": 688}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "如果能代代相传、坚持不懈，你们的家族必然强大。", "char_start": 689, "char_end": 712}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "“家族财务”绝不是指将家族的全部财富都集中起来，所有的家庭都只发些零花钱，这看似可以“合力”，但却会造成系统性的财务风险，一旦家族领导人犯下战略错误，会一次性将家族的财富付之一炬。", "char_start": 713, "char_end": 803}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "更不必说这样会导致家族内的权力斗争激化，家族成员的心灵扭曲。", "char_start": 804, "char_end": 834}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "这是一种战略性的错误。", "char_start": 835, "char_end": 846}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "正确的做法，正如上面所举例的这样——家族内各家庭的财务独立于家族基金， 彼此之间有分明严格的界限。", "char_start": 847, "char_end": 896}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "家族基金仅负责提供生存优势，不负责“保证生存”。如果你自甘堕落，将自然而然无法从家族基金中受益。即使灭亡，家族基金也并无“挽救”责任。", "char_start": 897, "char_end": 964}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "家族并不是自然选择的“对冲机制”，恰恰相反，它是对自然选择的欣然接受和积极参与。这条原则一旦搞错，家族不但不会成为家族成员的后盾，反而会成为ta们的角斗场和坟墓。", "char_start": 965, "char_end": 1046}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "先说到这里。", "char_start": 1048, "char_end": 1054}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 35}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0247"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：想创建一个家庭资金账户，想请有经验的朋友帮忙看看，提一下意见？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031"], "summary": "围绕“家族基金”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这种东西，切忌“民主”和“灵活”。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这种东西，切忌“民主”和“灵活”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 17, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "e02def7c-d18d-516a-ab4b-de583ff27e72", "source_ordinal": 2439, "reading_ordinal": 1615, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "学无门户", "published_at": "2023-01-17T23:58:59+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/564452584/answer/2850119796"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "一句话——", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 5}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "教有门户，学无门户。", "char_start": 6, "char_end": 16}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "不准你涉猎别家的师门，不入。不涉猎别家，自己的师门你也就懂不了。不知外家，也就不明内家。不能广博，“专精”就只是执拗造成的错觉——而且往往成为失败的根源。", "char_start": 17, "char_end": 94}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "因为世界上只有丰富而莫测的东西是没有确切弱点的。单调的东西，无论看似多么强大，都天然构成设计针对性的战术的理想基础，从根源上就是脆弱的。你就是一头霸王龙，咬合力能把煤球变成钻石，敌人也有极为简单的陷阱能把你杀绝种。只是在体育比赛中有具体的规则设计有意的把这些弱点遮掩起来，造成了错觉罢了。除非你学拳只是为了特定规则的体育比赛，否则作为学习者自限门户是天然荒谬的。", "char_start": 95, "char_end": 276}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "中国非常流行“驳则不纯，杂则不精”的训诫，这实际上更多的是古代师徒关系与经济利益深刻绑定而造成的伦理后果，是古代生产力样式在生产关系上留下的痕迹。", "char_start": 277, "char_end": 350}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这个时代过去了。", "char_start": 351, "char_end": 359}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 6}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0247"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：我想自学八卦掌，自学能练出真功夫吗?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006"], "summary": "围绕“学无门户”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“一句话——”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "一句话——", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 5, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "f603df5e-93e3-539f-9ea1-27c9f81d9c5f", "source_ordinal": 2438, "reading_ordinal": 1616, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "纳税人权利", "published_at": "2023-01-18T09:12:08+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/573785624/answer/2850392849"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "先看一个东西，然后再谈。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 12}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "税收改革", "char_start": 13, "char_end": 17}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "实际上，“纳税人享有额外的政治影响力”这个伦理有一个关键的前提——那就是地方政府收入与地方税收直接关联。", "char_start": 18, "char_end": 70}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这一点对美国是有效的。", "char_start": 71, "char_end": 82}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "美国的警察、教师、消防乃至地方政府的收入和当地的土地税、房产税有直接关联。", "char_start": 83, "char_end": 120}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这也是为什么美国会自然分化出泾渭分明的街区划分——", "char_start": 121, "char_end": 146}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "一个地区房价高，房产税就会对应的高，预算充足，就能保证充分的警力、教育、消防等公共资源，从而形成正向循环。", "char_start": 147, "char_end": 200}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "一旦房价低、地方税收少、预算匮乏，那么警察就少甚至干脆没有，教育就虚应故事……百病齐至，形成负向循环，帮会横行，化身治安地狱，铸成贫民窟。", "char_start": 201, "char_end": 270}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "基于这样一个财政机制，就会自然而然的产生“手握税源的地方大户不可避免的在地方享有政治特权”的伦理。", "char_start": 271, "char_end": 320}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "如果这些纳税人能交多少税，直接会影响警察、城管、城建、教师……直到政府机关的收入和福利，它很自然的会成为被保护和优待的对象。", "char_start": 321, "char_end": 383}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "这类“地方大型民企形成利益团体，官商勾结、一手遮天、欺行霸市”的现象，从根上讲，恰恰正是一种美国式的“纳税人权利”的真实体现。", "char_start": 384, "char_end": 447}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "这也是为什么上面这个税制改革对于中国最近十年的社会稳定至关重要的原因。", "char_start": 448, "char_end": 483}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "这不仅仅是一个“减少企业费用负担”和“精简机构”的问题，而事实上是一个国家性质问题、一个政体问题。", "char_start": 484, "char_end": 533}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "而既然这种改革已经悄无声息的以近乎百折不挠的决心完成了，本题实际上也就有了一个官方答案。", "char_start": 534, "char_end": 578}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "那就是中国并不认可纳税人拥有政治特权。", "char_start": 579, "char_end": 598}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "纳税人权利当然是有的，但那是对纳税义务的知情权、纳税相关信息的隐私权这类和纳税直接相关的事务性权利，而不是类似美国那样能让检察官和警察局长迎来送往、呼喝地方官如使仆役的政治特权。", "char_start": 599, "char_end": 688}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "这个回答可不是用什么文本或者宣传说出来的，", "char_start": 689, "char_end": 710}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "而是用调整87万个编制、将整整一个系统的部门机构合并裁撤的行动表达出来的。", "char_start": 711, "char_end": 748}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "这是不接受反驳的。", "char_start": 749, "char_end": 758}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 19}, "divergence": true, "divergence_count": 1}, "text_lexical_divergence": [{"reason": "text_has_content_not_in_lexical", "paragraph_kind": "body", "char_start": 13, "sample": "税收改革"}]}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0247"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么网上只要一提到“纳税人”这个词，一群人就开始上窜下跳地攻击你？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019"], "summary": "围绕“纳税人权利”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“先看一个东西，然后再谈。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "先看一个东西，然后再谈。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 12, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "f3ad35e8-3066-5e5c-8c65-e433848aa224", "source_ordinal": 2437, "reading_ordinal": 1617, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "劈柴", "published_at": "2023-01-19T04:13:35+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/40236614/answer/2851684960"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "对没技巧的人来说，最好的办法是用劈柴神器。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 21}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "用法很直白了——先轻敲把木头固定在尖头上，然后抡锤敲下去即可，这基本上不需要什么特别的技巧。", "char_start": 23, "char_end": 69}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "几十块钱一个，便宜得很。", "char_start": 70, "char_end": 82}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "但是要注意几点——", "char_start": 84, "char_end": 93}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "第一，高度要合适发力，这个要跟操作者的身材匹配，先自己模拟计算一下，问清楚商家尺寸再下单。", "char_start": 94, "char_end": 139}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "第二，在适合发力的前提下，越高越好。因为劈开的木柴会自然掉落在四周，如果越高，就会散落得越远，可以劈一大堆再收拾；如果太矮，那就劈几个就要收拾一圈，效率就低了。", "char_start": 140, "char_end": 220}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "第三，最好买那种带十字刀刃的，一锤分四瓣，效率更高。", "char_start": 221, "char_end": 247}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "第四，要找结实、稳固、平整、空旷的地面操作。不要东倒西歪，以免造成危险。", "char_start": 248, "char_end": 284}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这样你劈完了柴，还可以给老太爷留下个工具资产，不止可以帮他一次。", "char_start": 286, "char_end": 318}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "要说更轻松的也有，还挺流行的，使用也更灵活，但是属于电动工具，老太爷估计不爱用：", "char_start": 320, "char_end": 360}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "搜“劈柴钻头”即可。", "char_start": 362, "char_end": 372}], "images": [{"image_id": "IMG001", "src": "//asset.sooon.ai/p/2023-01/18/474531a9d8bbb1065f47edfca618f431.jpg", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}, {"image_id": "IMG002", "src": "//asset.sooon.ai/p/2023-01/18/ae0e770b076611b570b77cbe9fcbde07.jpg", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}, {"image_id": "IMG003", "src": "//asset.sooon.ai/p/2023-01/18/5ab5f2edbe0ecb4e2bece727731edae4.jpg", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 16, "image": 3}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "needs_reread", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0247"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何劈柴最好？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011"], "summary": "围绕“劈柴”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“对没技巧的人来说，最好的办法是用劈柴神器。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "对没技巧的人来说，最好的办法是用劈柴神器。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 21, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。 含图片节点，图片未经核验。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "d47d3cc5-7a24-5a1b-b775-10c5a06b3bc0", "source_ordinal": 2436, "reading_ordinal": 1618, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "35", "published_at": "2023-01-19T08:40:11+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/578481031/answer/2851782609"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这事很自然啊。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 7}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "基本上，社会默认为35岁以上的人理应将照顾家庭视为重要的义务，工作也要为家庭让步。全自动的认定35岁以上的人只适合做一些特定的成人的工作，一些年轻人的工作就不招了。", "char_start": 8, "char_end": 90}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这也是在警告低于35岁的人不要挥霍自己的变轨机会——小孩不能当到老。", "char_start": 91, "char_end": 125}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "在35岁之前你必须严肃的积累一些能保证你在35岁之后能依靠的真功夫、真人脉，而不是一直自欺欺人过家家、做春梦。", "char_start": 126, "char_end": 181}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "没有这根deadline，有些人是真的可以玩一辈子双脚不着地的。", "char_start": 182, "char_end": 214}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这个世界是完全严肃的，它充满幽默，尤其酷爱黑色幽默，但它从来也没跟你开玩笑。", "char_start": 215, "char_end": 253}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "到了deadline，你就知道什么是纸做的，什么是铁做的。", "char_start": 254, "char_end": 283}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "从另一个角度来说，尤其是公家机关做这个年龄限制其实无疑是对年轻人是有利的。", "char_start": 285, "char_end": 322}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这些限制主要是阻碍了35岁以上的人和年轻人竞争初级岗位。坦率讲，如果不限制，这些额外的竞争一定会压低薪资水平、抬高入职门槛。", "char_start": 323, "char_end": 385}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "别做“工资一样，资本家一定更喜欢年轻人能熬夜”的梦。工资如果一样，35岁心态稳健、人格成熟的资深员工比二十几岁小朋友恨不得一个可以顶两三个。", "char_start": 386, "char_end": 456}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "这是给年轻人留机会、留饭碗。就像设立退休年龄是给中年人留机会，留饭碗一样。", "char_start": 457, "char_end": 494}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "你难道真以为“老领导”到五六十岁就老糊涂了？", "char_start": 495, "char_end": 517}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "这是给你们的福利，居然有些小孩跟着别人一起喷，实属不知好歹。", "char_start": 518, "char_end": 548}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 16}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0247"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：35 岁分界线在政策、婚育、职场里无处不在， 为什么35 岁成了「中国式中年」的开端？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013"], "summary": "围绕“35”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这事很自然啊。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这事很自然啊。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 7, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "ba2a38db-2b13-5422-861e-d2c88a7c7c6c", "source_ordinal": 2435, "reading_ordinal": 1619, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "退休", "published_at": "2023-01-19T09:10:01+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/428005906/answer/2851816821"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "抱歉，没有退休计划。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 10}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "退休年龄是社会的安排，并没有必要成为你自己的个人计划的一部分。", "char_start": 11, "char_end": 42}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "个人而言，只有不同年龄段、不同身体条件下的工作计划，这些工作计划包括了失去视力版、失去行走能力版、失去单手版、失去双手版、偏瘫版、高位截瘫版……暂时只有植物人版和阿兹海默版没有方案，但这个问题幸好轮不到本人忧虑。", "char_start": 43, "char_end": 149}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "人们主动憧憬退休来对冲工作的痛苦，但这个就好像腿摔伤了不去打药手术，只憧憬总有一天切除了换了假肢就不疼了，实在是一种奇怪的“出路”。", "char_start": 150, "char_end": 216}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "你如果矢志不渝的去向深处钻研，你总有一天会发现把工作做得有乐趣是有系统的方法的。", "char_start": 217, "char_end": 257}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "春蚕到死丝方尽，只因吐丝真的爽。", "char_start": 259, "char_end": 275}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 7}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0247"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：当你退休了，你会怎样去过你的退休生活？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006"], "summary": "围绕“退休”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“抱歉，没有退休计划。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "抱歉，没有退休计划。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 10, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "29b258e1-d591-5992-bd56-037d86f08a73", "source_ordinal": 2434, "reading_ordinal": 1620, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "白羽恶魔", "published_at": "2023-01-19T18:39:39+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/936a773c97e511ed922052540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "针对辉瑞的“善行”说几句。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 13}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "老实说，辉瑞如果在那九十几个穷国不降价，它能赚到的钱不如降价多。", "char_start": 14, "char_end": 46}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "所谓“在G7国家维持高价”，这是它自己的市场策略原因，“美国政府不允许”只不过是个障眼法。", "char_start": 47, "char_end": 92}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "在本质上这跟“steam游戏在阿根廷很便宜，在美国就很贵”没有本质的区别，只不过是低边际成本的商品针对高度独立的市场实行差别定价的最常见的策略。", "char_start": 93, "char_end": 165}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这本质上跟“对贫穷国家施以义举”坦率讲没有关系，不要往G7头上贴金。", "char_start": 166, "char_end": 200}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "至于为什么G7其他国家不反对美国的“保价政策”，“愿意接受”辉瑞的收割，真正的奥秘其实是它们缺少反抗的武器。", "char_start": 201, "char_end": 255}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "什么反抗的武器？阻止辉瑞进入市场的政治资本和舆论管理能力。", "char_start": 256, "char_end": 285}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这几个国家要是胆敢抗拒美国的镰刀，转眼间它们国内的“专业杂志”和“自由媒体”就能让这些政治家付出毁灭性的代价。", "char_start": 286, "char_end": 341}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "所以它们当然“愿意”。", "char_start": 342, "char_end": 353}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "辉瑞执行的是老老实实的最大盈利策略——事实上也获得了极大的利润——然后加以一定的舆论包装缓和一下道德压力，安抚一下心理尚不成熟的顾客罢了。", "char_start": 354, "char_end": 423}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "从它的立场上讲，要赚钱本来就没有什么问题，但是把美国的药企看作道德君子，实属天真得可怕，对美国的医药史缺少基本的认知。", "char_start": 424, "char_end": 483}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "连这些药企自己都会觉得好笑。", "char_start": 484, "char_end": 498}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "这是一帮实打实的吸血鬼，是世界上最没有道德底线和伦理坚持的“恐怖资本主义”分子，而且是案底堆得比山高的这种惯犯。", "char_start": 499, "char_end": 555}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "那是真干得出为了买药让你上毒瘾、想变性、得抑郁，并且买通医院医学院和国会打开全部绿灯这种事的。", "char_start": 556, "char_end": 603}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "这帮人为了赚钱干出过的丧尽天良的事说出来你都难以相信，孟山都在他们面前都是乖宝宝，希特勒都太业余。", "char_start": 604, "char_end": 653}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "别的不谈——", "char_start": 654, "char_end": 660}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "你当为什么突然这几十年来“抑郁症”这么爆发性的大流行？", "char_start": 661, "char_end": 688}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "这帮卖改性yp的白羽魔鬼对此功不可没。", "char_start": 689, "char_end": 708}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "多读点历史，做人不要太天真了。", "char_start": 709, "char_end": 724}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 19}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0247"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：「Paxlovid 既买不到，又买不起」，为何辉瑞坚持不降价？辉瑞是否有社会责任让更多患者用上特效药？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019"], "summary": "围绕“白羽恶魔”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“针对辉瑞的“善行”说几句。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "针对辉瑞的“善行”说几句。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 13, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "64889885-1b0f-5dca-a8a7-7a8c3f9b7766", "source_ordinal": 2433, "reading_ordinal": 1621, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "绝后", "published_at": "2023-01-19T19:33:26+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/527710493/answer/2852598691"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "家族绝后是一种常见现象，大部分的家族都是这样一个命运。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 27}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "实际上现存的人类是很少的几个幸运的血脉交织的产物，说穿了往上数若干代基本属于同一家族根源。所以严格意义上说，灭绝的只是一个特定的分支。", "char_start": 28, "char_end": 95}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "家族的重要意义在于——从小在家里对某种东西耳熟能详，长大了不用学就了解了大量的常识，起步就在半山腰，并且有家族的物质积累辅助，这不仅仅容易获得生存优势，而且很容易把这些精神和物质遗产发扬光大。", "char_start": 96, "char_end": 192}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "因此家族往往不自觉的完成一些凭个人难以完成的长期事业。", "char_start": 193, "char_end": 220}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "例如“样式雷”积累的建筑样式，又如宁波范家的天一阁，又如日本金刚组。", "char_start": 221, "char_end": 255}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "它是通往“高水平生活”体验的系统捷径，一种平易近人，人人可以尝试的解决方案。", "char_start": 256, "char_end": 294}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "逻辑显然的——在有明确意识的前提下，将来更可能形成的格局是无家族可以依靠的人的后代要世代为有明确家族战略的家族子弟打工。", "char_start": 295, "char_end": 355}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "仅仅是没有这个意识，那么这是我弃权，但还没有出局。不一定哪一个后代看到了什么或者机缘巧合就成为了新家族的起点。", "char_start": 356, "char_end": 411}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "如果绝后，意味着在这个游戏中不但弃权，而且出局了。", "char_start": 412, "char_end": 437}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "这中间存在一种特殊的情况——那就是家族的真正核心是积累了战略优势的长期事业，而不是具体的血缘关系或者监护人关系。血缘抚养关系只是造就长期事业传承的其中一种途径。", "char_start": 438, "char_end": 518}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "这意味着即使不通过生育和抚养，也可以通过教育和学徒实现实质的家族传承。", "char_start": 519, "char_end": 554}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "这类似日本的歌舞伎传承——例如“市川海老藏某代目”和一些宗教的转世继承机制。", "char_start": 555, "char_end": 593}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "帮派、企业、政党的传承机制当然也属于这一类。", "char_start": 594, "char_end": 616}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "某种意义上讲，人如果不打算“人死如灯灭”，上面这些总要占到某一样。", "char_start": 618, "char_end": 651}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "占到了某一样，人在面对死亡和消逝的时候就会从容得多。", "char_start": 652, "char_end": 678}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "上面所有的这些，血缘家族是最简单、最久经考验、也最成熟的解决方案。", "char_start": 679, "char_end": 712}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "绝后意味着你抛弃或者说丢失了这个选择，如此而已。", "char_start": 713, "char_end": 737}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "这并不意味着没有替代方案，但是也不意味着“不需要替代方案”。", "char_start": 738, "char_end": 768}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "人生意义和遗产传承不像你想象的那么“毫无意义”，将来你早晚会明白的。", "char_start": 769, "char_end": 803}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "只不过对有些人而言，明白时会太晚了。", "char_start": 804, "char_end": 822}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 21}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0247"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：一个家族绝后了意味着什么？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020"], "summary": "围绕“绝后”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“家族绝后是一种常见现象，大部分的家族都是这样一个命运。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "家族绝后是一种常见现象，大部分的家族都是这样一个命运。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 27, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
